<title>USA: Service Corp Q4 earnings summary.</title>
<headline>Service Corp Q4 earnings summary.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Call mean estimate for Q4 was $0.30 per share</p>
<p>				1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr primary		$0.30		    $0.25</p>
<p> Shr diluted		 0.30		     0.24</p>
<p> Net			 73,756		   56,432</p>
<p> Revs		     609,492		  546,873</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 242,181		  232,580</p>
<p>		 Year</p>
<p> Shr primary		$1.10		    $0.90</p>
<p> Shr diluted		 1.07		     0.85</p>
<p> Net			265,298		  183,588</p>
<p> Revs		   2,294,194		1,652,126</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 241,178		  204,148</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - All share and per share data has been restated to reflect a two-for-one common stock split in August 1996.</p>
<p>((-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
